{title: Aankhon Hi Aankhon Me Ishara}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Geeta Dutt O P Nayyar}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Ankhon Hi Ankhon Hi Mein
[E]Ishara [D]Ho Gaya
[D]Baithe Baithe [A]Jine Ka
[E]Sahara [A]Ho Gaya
[A]Gate Ho Git [E]Kyu Dil Pe [A]Kyu Hath Hai
[A]Khoe Ho [E]Kis Liye, Aisi [A]Kya Bat Hai
[A]Ye Hal [E]Kab Se [A]Tumhara Ho Gaya
[A]Ankhon Hi Ankhon Hi....
[A]Chalate Ho [E]Jhum Ke Badali [A]Hai Chal Bhi
[A]Naino Me [E]Rang Hai Bikhare [A]Hai Bal Bhi
[A]Kis Dilaruba [E]Ka Nazara [A]Ho Gaya
[A]Ankhon Hi ...
[A]Ab Na Vo [E]Zor Hai, Ab [A]Na Vo Shor Hai
[A]Hamko Hai Sab [E]Pata Dil me [A]Kya Chor Hai
[A]Ye Chor [E]Kab Se [A]Gavara Ho Gaya
[A]Ankhon Hi Ankhon Hi
